      "writtenOn": "2026-07-22T01:31:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When safe `UnpackValue` callers pass a mutable evaluation result such as `[DefaultInfo()]`, the frozen check only panics in debug builds; release builds continue to this `unwrap_unchecked()` even though `item.unpack_frozen()` is `None`, causing undefined behavior.\n\nI\u0027m a bit worried about that \"safety by comment\" approach... could we return an error for mutable input or use a frozen-list API that makes this cast unnecessary?",
